{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/6ea3yw","slideIndex":0,"text":"Good morning. We are Ashish Ranjan, Khuushi Maheshwari and Satyanarayan H. Our project combines machine learning with an evolutionary algorithm to study trading strategies for Indian stocks. I will explain the purpose, how the system works, what we found and how to use our dashboard. This is a research simulator using historical data.\nSource: PROJECT.md."}
