{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/lslllq","slideIndex":2,"text":"We study three NSE stocks: Reliance, TCS and Infosys. The system reads daily price and volume data obtained through yfinance and stored as snapshots. It calculates twenty indicators, such as trend and momentum measures. Python runs the models and simulator, while Streamlit displays the results. The research test years are 2020 to 2025, with earlier historical data used for training.\nSources: PROJECT.md; reports/experiments/results/protocol.json."}
