{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/cxtrmz","slideIndex":5,"text":"These are archived rolling research results for 2020 to 2025, rather than values from a new dashboard run. The hybrid column is the median cumulative return across three random seeds. Buy-and-hold means holding the stock instead of following our trading rules. It earned more for all three stocks. Our system showed a risk-return tradeoff, so we cannot claim that it beat the market.\nSource: reports/experiments/results/stitched_aggregate_metrics.csv. Hybrid rows hybrid_seed_42, hybrid_seed_43, hybrid_seed_44; median total_return multiplied by100. Benchmark buy_and_hold total_return multiplied by100."}
