{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/bw1x9t","slideIndex":7,"text":"We built a complete tool that connects data, prediction, strategy search and evaluation. Our results show why honest testing matters: the hybrid strategies earned less than buy-and-hold in this study. Future work can evaluate more stocks and investigate better predictive features, while keeping the evaluation on later unseen data. Thank you for listening. We are happy to explain the algorithms or demonstrate the dashboard.\nSources: PROJECT.md; reports/experiments/results/stitched_aggregate_metrics.csv. Future work is proposed, not completed."}